<mj-text>Hi {{ trigger.name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>Thanks for sending us your {{ trigger.request_type | default: "message" }}. We've received it and will write back from <a href="mailto:hi@hydrilla.ai">hi@hydrilla.ai</a> if we need more detail.</mj-text>
